@startuml sequence-auth-session-m23
title SEQ-01: Authentication & Session Management Flow (UC-01 / BF-01)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "User\n(Learner / Staff)" as User
boundary "Web Client\n(BFF / Route Handler Proxy)" as Web
control "Supabase GoTrue Auth\n(Identity Provider)" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(PostgREST / RLS)" as DB
entity "AuditLog Store\n(TARGET Append-Only)" as Audit

== 1. Authentication & Token Exchange ==
User -> Web: Submit credentials (Email, Password)
activate Web
Web -> Auth: POST /auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
activate Auth

alt Valid Credentials
    Auth --> Web: 200 OK (access_token ES256, refresh_token, user_id)
    deactivate Auth

    Web -> DB: Query Profile by auth.uid() (RLS-enforced)
    activate DB
    DB --> Web: Return Profile (id, role;\naccount status: isActive / status [TARGET-CANDIDATE / OPEN DESIGN])
    deactivate DB

    alt Account Disabled (isActive = false / status = SUSPENDED [TARGET-CANDIDATE / OPEN DESIGN])
        Web -> Web: Invalidate session tokens & clear cookies
        Web --> User: 403 Forbidden (AUTH_ACCOUNT_DISABLED)\n[Redirect to support per UC-14]
    else Account Active (isActive = true)
        Web -> Web: Establish Secure Session\n(Set httpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax Cookie)\n[0 raw JWT in localStorage]

        opt Administrative Role Login (ADMINISTRATOR / MODERATOR / ORG_MANAGER)
            Web -> Audit: Record LOGIN event (userId, role, timestamp)
            activate Audit
            Audit --> Web: Acknowledged
            deactivate Audit
        end

        Web --> User: 200 OK (Redirect based on Profile.role)
    end

else Invalid Credentials
    activate Auth
    Auth --> Web: 400 Bad Request (Invalid login credentials)
    deactivate Auth
    Web --> User: 401 Unauthorized (AUTH_INVALID_CREDENTIALS)\n[Bilingual message, no user existence leak]
end

== 2. Session Refresh Flow ==
User -> Web: Request with expired access token cookie
Web -> Auth: POST /auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token
activate Auth
alt Refresh Token Valid
    Auth --> Web: 200 OK (New access_token, new refresh_token)
    deactivate Auth
    Web -> Web: Rotate httpOnly session cookie
    Web --> User: Continue authorized request
else Refresh Token Expired / Revoked
    activate Auth
    Auth --> Web: 400 Bad Request (Token expired)
    deactivate Auth
    Web -> Web: Clear session cookies
    Web --> User: 401 Unauthorized -> Redirect to /login
end

== 3. Safe Logout Flow ==
User -> Web: Click "Logout"
Web -> Auth: POST /auth/v1/logout (Revoke refresh_token)
activate Auth
Auth --> Web: 204 No Content
deactivate Auth
Web -> Web: Clear httpOnly cookies
Web --> User: Redirect to /login
deactivate Web

@enduml
